    <description>Launched from the Create RCA quick action on Account. Collects Section 1 RCA context (Primary Contact, Scanner Type, Primary Lab, Risk Signal Source, Date Risk Detected, Risk Severity) with best-effort prefill from the Account&#39;s Works with Labs and scanner Assets, then creates an at-risk (RCA) Onboarding, stamps the running user as Assigned Trainer, sets Create Tasks so the task generator builds the RCA tasks, and opens the new record. (INC3-30, INC3-35)</description>
